WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,440
Xiaotie, what are you doing?

2
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:05,790
What to do?

3
00:00:05,790 --> 00:00:07,980
Do you think I still can’t see it now?

4
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:09,980
Are you with this liar?

5
00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:13,660
Boy, who do you think is a liar?

6
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:17,420
Do you always have nightmares?

7
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:20,420
Is your waist so cold that it reaches your bones?

8
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:23,270
You are talking nonsense!

9
00:00:23,270 --> 00:00:25,880
Xiaotie can only set up a ghost hall

10
00:00:25,880 --> 00:00:27,880
You insist on giving him your old immortal?

11
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:29,980
There is a royal in your family

12
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:31,980
Where did the extra immortal come from?

13
00:00:31,980 --> 00:00:33,980
Who told you that Laoxian can be transferred or out of bounds?

14
00:00:33,980 --> 00:00:36,170
Give the money to Xiaotie so that he can take care of himself

15
00:00:36,170 --> 00:00:38,680
Okay, okay, I’ll give you the money, but don’t come looking for me in the future.

16
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:43,610
Xiaotie, I was responsible for your grandpa’s funeral.

17
00:00:43,610 --> 00:00:45,610
Village chief, I will always be grateful to you for this.

18
00:00:45,610 --> 00:00:47,610
I heard that you let the villagers do whatever they want.

19
00:00:47,610 --> 00:00:49,610
But I don’t know whose pocket this money went into.

20
00:00:49,610 --> 00:00:52,700
When I got desperate, I talked to the villagers.

21
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:57,370
Uncle Liu, why does Liar Wang have nightmares?

22
00:00:57,370 --> 00:01:00,400
Because of you, you were bullied by him

23
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:01,400
They went to take revenge on you

24
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:03,400
If only he could stop lying

25
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:05,690
You did a good deed

26
00:01:05,690 --> 00:01:07,690
They are from the ghost hall

27
00:01:07,690 --> 00:01:10,690
I picked up Tang Dan and they vented their anger on my behalf
